<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Bryan Saldana's Website</title>
    <style>
      /* Base Styles */
      body { 
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; 
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto; 
        padding: 40px 20px; 
        background: #f0f4f8; 
        color: #334e68;
      }
      
      /* Typography */
      h1 { 
        color: #102a43; 
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      
      h2 { 
        color: #1982c4; 
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        padding-bottom: 8px;
        border-bottom: 2px solid #d9e2ec; 
      }
      
      p { 
        line-height: 1.7; 
        margin: 0 0 10px 0;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }

      /* Layout Structure */
      .card {
        background: #ffffff;
        padding: 25px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 25px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        border-left: 5px solid #1982c4;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease;
      }

      .card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }
      
      /* Links & Interactive Elements */
      a {
        color: #1982c4;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: bold;
        transition: color 0.2s ease;
      }

      a:hover {
        color: #102a43;
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      .github-btn {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #1982c4;
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 10px 20px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        margin-top: 10px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .github-btn:hover {
        background: #102a43;
        color: #ffffff;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Hi, I'm Bryan Saldana!</h1>
 
    <div class="card">
      <h2>About Me</h2>
      <p>I am 5'10", Dominican, Ecuadorian, and Portuguese. I have luscious curly hair and a strong passion for music.</p>
    </div>
 
    <div class="card">
      <h2>My Interests</h2>
      <p>I love playing soccer and volleyball. I also used to skate and practice Taekwondo. In my free time, I enjoy watching content creators like Los Pollos and Joe Bart.</p>
    </div>
 
    <div class="card">
      <h2>My Goals for This Course</h2>
      <p>My focus is to earn my college credits and pass the class successfully.</p>
    </div>
 
    <div class="card">
      <h2>My GitHub</h2>
      <p>Check out my code repositories and latest development projects:</p>
      <a href="https://github.com/Bryan852245" class="github-btn" target="_blank">View Bryan852245 on GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
